aiah · Publish immutable release

Install package  /srv/ai-assets/dist/personal-1.2.3-personal.tar
Channel          /mnt/team-channel

Publishing writes the channel; a name/version/profile cannot be overwritten with different content.
If the channel is empty, a successful publish initializes its index and immutable package layout.
Type the full publish token and press Enter:
> publish

Esc Cancel; the install package remains in the library dist directory.
